  "prefLabel": "Lot 100 ORGANIZATION",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lot 100 ORGANIZATION\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2004, 97:1-9, effective 7-10-04, the Sweepstakes Commission was renamed the Lottery Commission. The rules filed as Chapter Sw 100 of the former Sweepstakes Commission in Document #6509, effective 5-15-97, as indicated in the source note were editorially renumbered as Chapter Lot 100 in November, 2020 to indicate rules of the Lottery Commission.\n\nAs organizational rules the rules in Chapter Lot 100 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
